  {
    "id": 3006003010340,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "行き交う人々よりも\r\n私の顔を見ている方が楽しいのかな？",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600301/3006003010340"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006003010350,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "鋭いねぇ\r\nだってほら、水も滴るいい女が隣にいるものだから",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600301/3006003010350"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006003010360,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……そうかい？\r\nフフ。ありがとう……",
