    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600301/3006003010430"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLabel": "yuika"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006003010440,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "嫌い……というほどではないよ\r\nそこまでの強い感情は持ってない",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600301/3006003010440"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006003010450,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ただ、傘で人の顔が良く見えないからかな\r\n雨の日は少し、感傷的な気分になってしまうんだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600301/3006003010450"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006003010460,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "へぇ……そうなんだね\r\n感傷的な気分かぁ。さくやんはすごいなぁ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600301/3006003010460"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006003010470,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "三峰だと、服が濡れちゃうとか髪がまとまらないとか、\r\nせいぜいそういうレベルだもん",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600301/3006003010470"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006003010480,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "結華も、雨の日は苦手なのかい？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600301/3006003010480"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006003010490,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ううん、ぜんぜん苦手じゃない\r\n三峰には、雨の日だけのお楽しみもあるし",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600301/3006003010490"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006003010500,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "へえ、お楽しみか……\r\nいったい、どんな素敵なことがあるんだい？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600301/3006003010500"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006003010510,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……それが、実は傘なんだなー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600301/3006003010510"
  },
  {
    "id": 3006003010520,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "え……？　傘？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300600301/3006003010520"
  },
  {
